OL,3,AHarry Styles funds free coffee at two
OL,4,ALondon cafes
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Styles bought coffees for all of
OL,7,Fthe visitors to his "favourite" London
OL,8,Fcoffee shop to celebrate the extension
OL,9,Fof his record-breaking Together,
OL,10,FTogether tour.
OL,12,FThe singer funded free coffees for all
OL,13,Fof the customers at Kaffeine's two
OL,14,Fcentral London cafes on Saturday
OL,15,Fthrough promoter Live Nation.
OL,17,FOwner Peter Dore-Smith said he was not
OL,18,Fallowed to promote the free drinks on
OL,19,Fsocial media, but could tell customers
OL,20,Fthat they had been bought by Together,
OL,21,FTogether, the name of the artist's
OL,22,Ftour.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
